# Visual redesign is loaded

When the user talks about beauty, enjoyment, restyle, or “I am not a designer”:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/visual-redesign/SKILL.md`.
2. Follow `.cursor/rules/frontend-ui-stack.mdc` for Svelte/MCP/browser.
3. You own artistic direction. Do not ask the user to invent the look.
4. Do not start a full restyle until they say to begin — except loading tools, direction, and token plans.

Public reading UI (`frontend/src` minus admin) is the canvas. Tokens live in `frontend/src/app.css`.
